# Work Graph Protocol

Use the Work Graph Protocol whenever the task is multi-step, long-running, cross-file, or should appear on the board.

## Required
- Preserve `[T-xx]` refs exactly
- Create new tasks via `planctl add-task`
- Split tasks via `planctl split-task`
- Merge tasks via `planctl merge-tasks`
- Do not silently delete tasks
- Sync plan edits via `planctl sync-plan`
- Record blockers via `planctl block`
- Verify before `planctl done`

## Plan location
- `.workgraph/plans/*.md`

## Conflict rule
If this rule conflicts with existing project-specific rules, keep the existing project-specific rules and adapt this workflow around them instead of replacing them.
